1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,007
Si llevas días sin ir

2
00:00:02,007 --> 00:00:02,982
al baño,

3
00:00:02,982 --> 00:00:04,048
mira esto.

4
00:00:04,786 --> 00:00:06,893
Cuando tu intestino va lento,

5
00:00:06,893 --> 00:00:09,437
lo que comes se queda atrapado.

6
00:00:09,537 --> 00:00:10,889
Se acumulan gases,

7
00:00:10,889 --> 00:00:12,021
