14
00:00:20,548 --> 00:00:21,960
y un empujón.

15
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,167
Por eso existe American Fit,

16
00:00:24,167 --> 00:00:25,579
de American Natural.

17
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:26,654
Trae sen,

18
00:00:26,654 --> 00:00:27,629
fibra prebiótica,

19
00:00:27,629 --> 00:00:28,981
magnesio, vitamina C

20
00:00:28,981 --> 00:00:30,393
y té matcha.

21
00:00:30,493 --> 00:00:31,468
Sesenta cápsulas,

22
00:00:31,468 --> 00:00:32,977
